  <h3>2(b) TOTP Multi-Factor Authentication &amp; Role-Based Access Control (1.5 Marks)</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>TOTP MFA:</strong> Built to RFC 6238 standard using <code>speakeasy</code> and <code>qrcode</code>, generating 30-second rotating codes for Google and Microsoft Authenticator. JWT tokens are issued only upon valid TOTP verification.</li>
    <li><strong>RBAC Protection:</strong> Restricts <code>PUT /api/menu/:id</code>, <code>DELETE /api/menu/:id</code>, and <code>DELETE /api/feedback/:id</code> to authenticated <code>admin</code> and <code>supervisor</code> roles.</li>
  </ul>

  <table>
    <tr>
      <th>API Test Operation</th>
      <th>Target Endpoint</th>
      <th>Token / Auth Header Provided</th>
      <th>HTTP Status</th>
      <th>Verification Result</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Unauthenticated Update</strong></td>
      <td><code>PUT /api/menu/:id</code></td>
      <td>None (Missing header)</td>
      <td><strong>401 Unauthorized</strong></td>
      <td><span class="badge-success">PASSED: Access Denied</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Unauthenticated Delete</strong></td>
      <td><code>DELETE /api/feedback/:id</code></td>
      <td>None (Missing header)</td>
      <td><strong>401 Unauthorized</strong></td>
      <td><span class="badge-success">PASSED: Access Denied</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Forged / Tampered Token</strong></td>
      <td><code>PUT /api/menu/:id</code></td>
      <td>Malformed JWT signature</td>
      <td><strong>401 Unauthorized</strong></td>
      <td><span class="badge-success">PASSED: Tampering Blocked</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Student Role Delete Attempt</strong></td>
      <td><code>DELETE /api/feedback/:id</code></td>
      <td>Valid JWT with role <code>student</code></td>
      <td><strong>403 Forbidden</strong></td>
      <td><span class="badge-success">PASSED: Role Defense Active</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Authorized Admin Operation</strong></td>
      <td><code>PUT /api/menu/:id</code></td>
      <td>Valid Admin JWT (MFA verified)</td>
      <td><strong>200 OK</strong></td>
      <td><span class="badge-success">PASSED: Authorized &amp; Executed</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

